data.creator_notes:
1.1: Added a new greeting based on the second """game""". Take the bimbofied Marin-chan together with your buddies. More CG and a very slight touch-up. Take note that when updating the lorebook, you have to delete the old one and then re-import it.
1.2: Added a third greeting per anon's request. Gojo-kun walks out for a bit and the already corrupted Marin forces (You) into giving her the D.

Buy Marin-chan for yourself as you have an ecstatic time while the girl's head fries from the internal struggle. Some """creative liberties""" were taken.

Features erotic CG in the form of catbox links. Make sure to import the lorebook for it to work. The man is fat in the source material so the CG may not fit your persona description. Also, obviously MalePOV.

If the images appear too big for you, add this to your Custom CSS in the User Settings:
img {
max-width: 100%;
}


Source for the CG is Sono Bisque Doll ni Nakadashi Sasete Kure 1 and 2. Should be Studio34 on DLSite but I can't find it.

Tested only on GPT4. Will probably link the wrong stuff on Claude and sometimes on gepetee as well.
